  "scope": "OpenJDK 21 font shaping diagnostics during checked-JNI spreadsheet tests",
  "status": "Accepted external OpenJDK 21 diagnostic after root-cause and standalone Java control qualification.",
  "root_cause": "OpenJDK 21 libfontmanager calls CallObjectMethod in glyph metrics/table callbacks and then GetFloatField/GetArrayLength without ExceptionCheck. Xcheck:jni reports this even when the call succeeds. A pure Java TextLayout control reproduces the same SunLayoutEngine.shape origin without loading Qore or JNI module.",
